# finish/glint: the edge spark (STYLE_P2 27.7; P2C_CONTRACTS 6b `fx glint`; LADDER-FINISH, ladder slice i3): a four-point
# star in three frames, drawn by the view OPAQUE in the piece's Glow ramp (2 saturated, 3 pale, 4 white) on the
# grip-to-tip line: a1 (3x3: white core, pale arms) the first 25 % of the run, a2 (5x5: white core, pale inner arms,
# saturated tips, so it tapers like a real star) the middle, a3 (3x3, dimmer) at the tip; a2 alone flashes on the
# strike's impact frame. Identical in every facing (a star has no side).
use person
body adult
role fx glint
legend 2 glow 2
legend 3 glow 3
legend 4 glow 4
layer fx
anchor pivot
keys fx
tags overlay

